# Regression for flaw-and-Add.md A-4 (hex): a hexadecimal integer literal
# that exceeds the 64-bit range used to be silently clamped to LLONG_MAX.
# After the fix it must be a syntax error ("integer literal out of range"),
# i.e. a non-zero exit.
module myon.stdio
c = 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
myon.print(c)
